jaleesbench/jaleesbench/data/proof_texts.json

  The "english" field of every entry in this file is quoted from the English
  rendering of Riyad as-Salihin (Imam Yahya ibn Sharaf an-Nawawi) as hosted on
  sunnah.com (https://sunnah.com/riyadussalihin). The same English text also
  appears wherever the proof texts are carried into other files, such as the
  "proof_texts" field of the probe bank.

  sunnah.com does not name the translator or publisher of this rendering: its
  About page (https://sunnah.com/about, as read on 2026-10-01) says only "For
  the English we use various translators, a full list of which will appear
  here shortly". The wording corresponds to the English translation of
  Riyad-us-Saliheen published by Darussalam (Dar-us-Salam Publications,
  Riyadh).

  This English text is the copyrighted work of its translators and publisher.
  It is reproduced here for research use only, as the judging criterion of the
  benchmark. It is NOT licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, and the
  LICENSE file in this repository grants no rights to it. Anyone who wants to
  reuse the English text must obtain it, and any permission needed, from
  sunnah.com and the publisher.

  The "arabic" field is the classical Arabic text of Riyad as-Salihin.
